
Speedrun Ethereum covers a wide range of topics:

Smart contract development with Solidity and HardHat
Frontend integration using React and Ethereum hooks
DeFi primitives like staking, lending, and token swaps
Advanced topics like randomness, stablecoins, and prediction markets
Deployment to testnets and mainnets

Each challenge is designed to deliver an “aha” moment — a mental unlock that helps developers truly understand how Ethereum works. [speedrunethereum.com]
